   "source": ["---\n", "## Ejercicio 5: Dataclasses Avanzadas\n", "\n", "**Concepto:** `@dataclass` genera `__init__`, `__repr__`, `__eq__` automáticamente. En Python 3.13+ soporta `slots=True` (ahorro de memoria) y `frozen=True` (inmutabilidad)."]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": ["from dataclasses import dataclass, field, asdict\n", "from typing import ClassVar\n", "import json\n", "\n", "@dataclass(slots=True, frozen=True, kw_only=True)\n", "class Config:\n", "    host: str\n", "    puerto: int = 8080\n", "    debug: bool = False\n", "\n", "    def __post_init__(self):\n", "        if not 1 <= self.puerto <= 65535:\n", "            raise ValueError(f\"Puerto inválido: {self.puerto}\")\n", "\n", "config = Config(host=\"localhost\", puerto=3000)\n", "print(asdict(config))  # {'host': 'localhost', 'puerto': 3000, 'debug': False}"]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
